  "body": "## Description\r\n\r\nThis is a tracking issue for PRs and issues related to [invariance](https://stackoverflow.com/questions/112064/what-is-an-invariant) in the synapse codebase, to ensure extra stability and reduce undefined behaviour.\r\n\r\nThe plan is two-fold:\r\n1. Reduce dynamic behaviour to statically-verifiable behaviour, where behaviour is explicitly notated instead of implicitly processed.\r\n2. Introduce static typing annotations everywhere, to make it possible to check for undefined or variant behaviour.\r\n\r\nSmall PRs will be introduced cleaning these up iteratively.\r\n\r\n### PRs\r\n\r\n## To-Dos / Spotted Issues\r\n\r\n- [ ] Convert [`synapse.server.HomeServer.__init__()`](https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/blob/14b5b48a2285a43f655030ec242b92d217c1994a/synapse/server.py#L229-L230) from dynamic to static behaviour.\r\n    (e.g. by adding `__init__()` signatures to subclasses, then disallowing receiving `**kwargs`)",
